0013C3  3               ;-----------------------------------------------
0013C3  3               ; Divide d by e and return in d, remainder in a.
0013C3  3               ;
0013C3  3               ; Input:
0013C3  3               ;  D = first number
0013C3  3               ;  E = second number
0013C3  3               ;
0013C3  3               ; Output:
0013C3  3               ;  D = result D/E
0013C3  3               ;  A = remainder
